panies","Routes including:","Modern fleets of conventional and electric buses","Stable and professional working environment"],"responsibilities":["Transport passengers safely and comfortably","Follow assigned schedules and routes","Deliver excellent customer service to passengers","Operate both conventional and electric buses","Perform basic vehicle inspections before each shift","Report delays, incidents, and technical issues promptly","Comply with all road safety regulations and company procedures"]}$q$::jsonb),
